ss=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Written by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"illustration\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Illustrated by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Werther_Dell%27Edera\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">Werther Dell'Edera</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"colors\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Colors by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miquel_Muerto\" title=\"Miquel Muerto\">Miquel Muerto</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"letters\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Lettered by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/AndWorld_Design\" title=\"AndWorld Design\">AndWorld Design</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"release_date\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Release date</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">January 27, 2021</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Chronology</caption>\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_13\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 13\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #13</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_15\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 15\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #15</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #14</b> is a horror comic from <a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Werther_Dell%27Edera\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">Werther Dell'Edera</a> that was published on January 27, 2021 by <a href=\"/wiki/Boom!_Studios\" title=\"Boom! Studios\">Boom! Studios</a>. It is the fourteenth issue in the <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i> comic series, the four issue of the five-part <i><a href=\"/wiki/A_Game_of_Nowhere_(comic_arc)\" title=\"A Game of Nowhere (comic arc)\">A Game of Nowhere</a></i> arc, and the fourteenth issue of the fifteen-part <i>Archer's Peak</i> saga.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Synopsis\">Synopsis</span></h2>\n<blockquote><p>To save the town, <a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica</a> must take on the brood of monsters on her own. And <span class=\"new\" title=\"Tommy (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVG9tbXk/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Tommy</span> is faced with a decision that means life or death.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></p></blockquote>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Plot\">Plot</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Bian\" title=\"Bian\">Bian</a> is afraid of <a href=\"/wiki/Octo\" title=\"Octo\">Octo</a>'s ghostly form, and asks why he looks like that. <a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a> responds that she was taught to tame monsters, and taming Octo changed his shape. Some of the other children there made their monsters look pretty, but she never wanted to forget that Octo killed her parents and friend. She has the children lay down on either side of Octo and play the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Game of Nowhere (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvR2FtZV9vZl9Ob3doZXJlP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Game of Nowhere</span>, picturing things in their mind and focusing intently on them. She has <a href=\"/wiki/James\" title=\"James\">James</a> tell her about the first time he imagined the monster. He was alone in the house, chatting with his friends on the computer. When he turned off the computer, he was alone in the dark, and he thought he saw a big face in the window. He got so scared thinking about it, he stayed up until two in the morning, and ran to his room. The next night, he told <a href=\"/wiki/Tyler_Monitz\" title=\"Tyler Monitz\">Tyler Monitz</a> that he'd seen said monster, and they dared each other to go into the woods to look for it. James focuses on the monster's image, and Erica tells Bian to imagine the monster in the ravine. Octo then takes on the monster mother's form.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Maxine_Slaughter\" title=\"Maxine Slaughter\">Maxine Slaughter</a> tells everyone to go to the center of the gym and empty their bags, threatening <a href=\"/wiki/Joe_Cavanaugh\" title=\"Joe Cavanaugh\">Joe Cavanaugh</a> with an axe. <a href=\"/wiki/Tommy_Mahoney\" title=\"Tommy Mahoney\">Tommy Mahoney</a> apologizes to <a href=\"/wiki/Ms._Mahoney\" title=\"Ms. Mahoney\">his mother</a>, just as he finds his mother over <a href=\"/wiki/Sophie_Mahoney\" title=\"Sophie Mahoney\">Sophie</a>'s body. Tommy gives an insistent Maxine his phone, and she allows them two minutes to say goodbye to Sophie.\n</p><p>Erica explains that James shaped Octo into the monster, and that he needs to watch Bian. She opens the door, and Octo calls for the monster's children, summoning them.\n</p><p>Ms. Mahoney asks Tommy if they are going to be killed, and that she wishes it would just happen now. Tommy tells her that he is going to keep her safe, and he is going to get her out of there and Sophie into a proper grave. Tommy then marches into the crowd, and tells Cavanaugh that he's ready to give the White Masks a better story.\n</p><p>Octo tells Erica that the monsters are coming. She attacks all three of them at once.\n</p><p>Tommy demands that Cavanaugh arrest him. He shouts a confession that he killed all of the kids, and everybody saw him kill that little girl in the parking lot. Because if they saw him as the killer, then nothing would need to be covered up. Maxine tells him that this is crazy, and they should end this another way.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Characters\">Characters</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Order_of_St._George\"><a href=\"/wiki/Order_of_St._George\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Order of St. George\">Order of St. George</a></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Octo\" title=\"Octo\">Octo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Maxine_Slaughter\" title=\"Maxine Slaughter\">Maxine Slaughter</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span id=\"Archer.27s_Peak\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Archer's_Peak\"><a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak</a></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bian\" title=\"Bian\">Bian</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Joe_Cavanaugh\" title=\"Joe Cavanaugh\">Sheriff Joe Cavanaugh</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/James\" title=\"James\">James</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ms._Mahoney\" title=\"Ms. Mahoney\">Ms. Mahoney</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Sophie_Mahoney\" title=\"Sophie Mahoney\">Sophie Mahoney</a> †</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Tommy_Mahoney\" title=\"Tommy Mahoney\">Tommy Mahoney</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Monsters\"><a href=\"/wiki/Monster\" title=\"Monster\">Monsters</a></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Oscuratypes\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Oscuratypes\">Oscuratypes</a>\n<ul><li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype children (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfY2hpbGRyZW4/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Archer's Peak Oscuratype children</span></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"90dedb7daba7a5705aa09e60ae5a7761\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_14_Cover-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:120px; top:0.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_14_Cover.jpg\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 14 Cover.jpg (747 KB)\" style=\"height:184px; width:120px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/b/b3/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_14_Cover.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/120?cb=20230226173542\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 14 Cover.jpg (747 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Something Is Killing the Children